m.x:
The Board of Directors of Toronto Parking Authority:

1. Approved the proposed 2024 Operating Budget and 2024 - 2026 Capital Budget for Toronto Parking Authority.

2. Approved the rates at the off-street parking facilities identified in Attachment 3-2 to this report (October 20, 2023) from the President, Toronto Parking Authority;

3. Provided authority for the President, Toronto Parking Authority to establish new permit parking products at market rates at all off-street parking facilities where there is surplus capacity in the supply of parking and the issuance of permits does not compromise the ability to meet short-term parking demands;

4. Approved the modified rates for on-street parking locations identified in Attachments 2 and 2-3;

5. Approved the modification to the parking meter or parking machine hours for the specific on-street parking locations identified in Attachment 2-2 to this report and;

6. Directed the President, Toronto Parking Authority to submit bills to City Council to make amendments to the appropriate Chapters of the Toronto Municipal Code to implement the rates for on-street parking locations identified in Attachments 2 and 2-3 to this report; and modifications to the parking meter or parking machine hours for the specific on-street parking locations identified in Attachment 2-2 to this report.
